case ok-behavior-ack
desc behavior answers a BOTSTATE stream first and then its acknowledgement
module yes
send addon behavior Alpha
frame addon PARTY TBM behavior Alpha
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:BOTSTATE_BEGIN|1
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:BOTSTATE|Alpha|state=follow
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:BOTSTATE_END
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:ACTION_ACK|behavior|bot:Alpha|1|-
expect botstate.count 1
expect ack.count 1
expect ack.0.intent behavior
expect ack.0.scope bot:Alpha
expect ack.0.count 1
expect ack.0.detail -
expect problems.count 0
